### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ATTACHMENTS WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/Attachments
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@attachmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@responseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ATTACHMENT BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. DOWNLOAD ALL FILES FROM REQUEST (as ZIP)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Attachments/request/{{requestId}}/download-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. DOWNLOAD ALL FILES FROM RESPONSE (as ZIP)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Attachments/response/{{responseId}}/download-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. DOWNLOAD ALL FILES FROM TRANSACTION (as ZIP)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Attachments/transaction/{{transactionId}}/download-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
